Notes on how to split a commit in Git. Occasionally needed.
// Specify the point to split. Edit the target commit.
git rebase -i HEAD~5

// The target commit is unstaged
git reset HEAD~

// Add & commit at any granularity
git add ~
git commit ~

git rebase --continue

